 "strings": {
  "Your run-of-the-mill researcher wouldn't have\nthe cash or connections.": "",
  "But what if someone close to him did?": "",
  "Doesn't have to be Shono himself.\nMaybe someone close to him.": "",
  "Someone Shono knows who's got yakuza ties?\nThe hell could that be?": "",
  "Shigeru Kajihira, chairman of the Kajihira Group.": "",
  "The contact between Shono and Hamura must be...\nShigeru Kajihira, chairman of the Kajihira Group.": "",
  "I'm not so sure about that, Yagami-san.": "",
  "No, I'm not so sure...": "",
  "Think about it. The murdered Kyorei yakuza\nare Kajihira's men.": "",
  "The Mole's victims have mostly been Kyorei.\nThey're already on Kajihira's side.": "",
  "Besides, there's no evidence of any\nconnection between him and Shono.": "",
  "Besides, there's no evidence of any connection\nbetween him and Shono.": "",
  "I guess you have a point there...": "",
  "That's true. I guess you have\na point there...": "",
  "Well we can rule Kajihira out.\nWho was Shono's go-between, then?": "",
  "Well, there's gotta be some connection between\nShono and Hamura. Question is, who?": "",
  "The Minister of Health, Naohisa Kazami.": "",
  "You think an active cabinet member\nis out hooking Shono up with yakuza? Seriously?": "",
  "An active cabinet member, out\nhooking Shono up with yakuza? Seriously?": "",
  "Hm... I suppose the minister\nwould have enough power.": "",
  "Hm... I suppose the minister <font_kind=yakuza_italic>would</font_kind>\nhave enough power.": "",
  "But I'm not sure he has the motive.\nEspecially not for such a risky move.": "",
  "But I don't know if he'd be willing\nto take that kind of political risk.": "",
  "Who else do we have, then?": "",
  "Someone who could get\nHamura and Shono in touch...": "",
  "Someone who could get Hamura\nand Shono in touch... Let's see...": "",
  "Ryusuke Kido, director of the ADDC.": "",
  "Director of the ADDC. Ryusuke Kido.": "",
  "Oh, I see what you mean!": "",
  "...Interesting.": "",
  "Kido would have access to ADDC funding.": "",
  "Kido <font_kind=yakuza_italic>would</font_kind> have access to ADDC funding.": "",
  "There's even been talk of him having\nties to the yakuza somehow, right?": "",
  "There's even been talk of him having ties\nto the yakuza somehow, right?": "",
  "I think you've cracked it,\nYagami-san! It had to be Kido!": "",
  "Of course! It had to be Kido!": "",
  "Uh, I dunno if that's really true.": "",
  "Think back to the AD-9 press conference.\nYou remember the look on Kido's face?": "",
  "Well, think back. Remember the AD-9 press conference?\nDid you look at Kido's face?": "",
  "He was so proud. Innocent, even.": "",
  "The guy was practically beaming, wasn't he?": "",
  "But if he knew about all this human experiment\nshit? No way he'd look like that.": "",
  "But if he knew about all this human experiment shit?\nNo way Kido would be so peppy.": "",
  "Kid's got a point.": "",
  "Hm, then maybe he was only told about the\nexperiments after the conference took place.": "",
  "Then... maybe he found out about the experiments\nlater. After the conference took place.": "",
  "That would still make sense, right?": "",
  "First, Shono gets Kido to sign off on the AD-9\npaper and publicly gives him all the credit.": "",
  "For Shono's first move, he gets Kido to sign off on the\nAD-9 paper, and lets him take the public credit.": "",
  "Thrilled about the possibilities, Kido proudly\npresents the research at that press conference.": "",
  "Thrilled about the possibilities, Kido proudly presents\nthe research at that press conference.": "",
  "There's no turning back after that,\neven if he found out about the experiments.": "",
  "That way, even if he found out about the experiments,\nthere'd be no turning back for him.": "",
  "That's probably how\nShono got Kido on his side.": "",
  "I'd guess that's probably how\nShono got Kido on his side.": "",
  "He then used Kido's funding and connections\nto bring in Hamura and the Mole.": "",
  "He then used Kido's funding and connections,\npulling in Hamura and the Mole.": "",
  "It feels like all the pieces\nare falling into place.": "",
  "It sounds plausible. All the pieces\nare falling into place.": "",
  "Yeah, yeah.": "",
  "That means...\nKido's not actually the one in charge.": "",
  "That means... Kido's not actually\nthe one in charge.": "",
  "Right. Shono is behind everything.": "",
  "Right. Shono is behind the Mole\nand everything else.": "",
  "Let's say you're right.\nWhen did Shono start usin' this guy?": "",
  "Well, let's say you're right.\nWhen did Shono start usin' this assassin?": "",
  "When was the Mole's first murder?": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(The first time Shono actually used an assassin\nwould have to be...)</color>": "",
  "Shono murdered a patient, Waku-san, three years ago.\nHe and the Mole may have started working together then.": "",
  "Three years ago, Shono murdered that patient.\nMaybe he got in contact with the Mole around then.": "",
  "But that was probably an accident, right?\nHe didn't mean for Waku-san to die.": "",
  "But everything points to that death being an accident.\nHe didn't <font_kind=yakuza_italic>mean</font_kind> for Waku-san to die.": "",
  "In other words,\nhe wouldn't need the Mole.": "",
  "He wouldn't need the Mole for that.": "",
  "Oh, right.\nMaybe it was a different time, then.": "",
  "Oh, right. Then... maybe the\ntiming was different.": "",
  "Well? When was it?": "",
  "So when was it?": "",
  "Probably Hashiki's death six months ago.": "",
  "Probably when the Mole murdered\nHashiki six months ago.": "",
  "And why do you say that?": "",
  "Hashiki inching closer to the truth about AD-9\nwas a serious problem for Shono.": "",
  "Shono had to silence him. He couldn't let Hashiki\nget closer to the truth of AD-9.": "",
  "But as we know,\nShono was in a taxi at the time of the beating.": "",
  "But as we know, Shono's alibi placed him in a taxi\nat the time of the beating.": "",
  "Meaning someone else must have been\nresponsible for Hashiki's death.": "",
  "If we know that's true, someone else must have\nbeen responsible for Hashiki's death.": "",
  "The man in the black raincoat.\nHe's the Mole?": "",
  "So that leaves the man in the black raincoat.\nHe's the Mole?": "",
  "When those Kyorei guys started\ngetting their eyes gouged out.": "",
  "That would make the most sense.": "",
  "The timing checks out.": "",
  "Well that's pretty damn recent.": "",
  "Pretty damn recent.": "",
  "Hm. What about Hashiki's death, then?": "",
  "Shono has an alibi for the night\nHashiki was beat to death.": "",
  "If he didn't hire somebody to do it...": "",
  "Maybe it really was\njust a random passerby.": "",
  "...Maybe Hashiki's death really was\njust the fault of a random passerby?": "",
  "No, that doesn't fit\nwith the rest of the story.": "",
  "No, that doesn't fit with the\nrest of the story.": "",
  "Hashiki inching closer to the truth about\nAD-9 was a serious problem for Shono.": "",
  "So, Shono hired someone to off him.": "",
  "So... to get Hashiki out of the picture...\nhe hired the Mole.": "",
  "Then, the man in the black raincoat?\nHe's the Mole?": "",
  "That must've been his first job, huh?": "",
  "Man, that must've been his\nfirst assignment.": "",
  "Yeah. Only the best of the best assassins would have\nthe skill to do what they did to Hashiki.": "",
  "Yeah. Judging by how he was beaten,\nthe killer had real skills.": "",
  "Seems right... Told you that myself.": "",
  "Who knows how close Hashiki was to finding out about\nthe human experimentation before he died.": "",
  "Who knows how close Hashiki was to finding out\nabout the human experimentation before he died.": "",
  "Yeah and if he had, that would have been\nthe end of the line for Shono.": "",
  "Yes. It would have spelled\nthe end for Shono.": "",
  "Seems like a plausible motive to me.": "",
  "Seems like a plausible motive\nto kill Hashiki.": "",
  "So what, everything just... makes sense?": "",
  "So what, everything just makes sense?": "",
  "I dunno...": "",
  "Man, I dunno...": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Looks like Sugiura still isn't\ntotally on board.)</color>": "",
  "If you have something to say,\nsay it.": "",
  "Got something to say? Go ahead.": "",
  "I mean... this is still\njust a theory, right?": "",
  "We came up with plenty of theories,\nbut they're still just theories.": "",
  "It all sounds almost too convenient.": "",
  "If you ask me, all your guesses\nsound <font_kind=yakuza_italic>too</font_kind> convenient.": "",
  "If Shono killed Waku-san\nat the ADDC three years ago...": "",
  "If Shono killed Waku-san at the ADDC\nthree years ago...": "",
  "Then Okubo, the primary suspect in the case,\nwould be totally in the clear.": "",
  "Well, Okubo would be totally in the clear.\nHe'd be cleared of all suspicion.": "",
  "Yup. Already proved that in court, remember?": "",
  "Yup. Guy's innocent.\nAlready proved that in court, remember?": "",
  "But Okubo, he...\nHe killed his girlfriend right after.": "",
  "But Okubo, he... He killed\nhis girlfriend right after.": "",
  "He stabbed her over and over.\nEven set the place on fire.": "",
  "Reeked of booze too,\neven though he was supposed to be dry.": "",
  "Reeked of booze too, even though\nhe was supposed to be dry.": "",
  "Defend him all you want,\nbut the guy's a murderer.": "",
  "Defend him all you want...\nbut the guy's a murderer.": "",
  "That's why the whole thing was such a big deal.\nEveryone realized the court made a mistake.": "",
  "Isn't that why everyone freaked out?\nThey realized the court made a mistake.": "",
  "It took the death of an innocent girl for them\nto realize that Okubo probably did it after all.": "",
  "After all that, Okubo probably\nwas the real murderer.": "",
  "Yet here you are, claiming the court\ngot it right. Claiming Okubo's innocent.": "",
  "Yet here you are, claiming the court got it right\nand Okubo's innocent.": "",
  "But you just don't want to feel responsible\nfor Emi Terasawa's death. That's it, isn't it?": "",
  "But Emi Terasawa's still dead. And you just can't\nface the fact that it was your fault. Right?": "",
  "Enough, Sugiura! You're way outta line,\nand you don't know shit!": "",
  "That's enough, Sugiura!\nLearn to shut the fuck up!": "",
  "...Look, I know I get swept up in\nmy emotions pretty easily sometimes.": "",
  "...Look, I get it. I know it's easy for me\nto get swept up in my emotions.": "",
  "All the same,\nI'm trying to be fair here.": "",
  "That's why I'm trying\nto be fair here.": "",
  "Are you?": "",
  "Say what?": "",
  "So, if we wanna treat Yagami-san's\ntheory like it's the truth...": "",
  "If we wanna treat Yagami-san's theory\nlike it's the truth...": "",
  "Then we'll have to figure out whether or not\nOkubo is innocent. If he actually killed Waku-san.": "",
  "...Then we'll have to know if Okubo's really innocent.\nOr that he did kill Waku-san back at the ADDC.": "",
  "And how're you suggesting we do that?": "",
  "Just like that?\nWhat're we s'posed to do?": "",
  "It's simple.": "",
  "We talk to Okubo.": "",
  "We just go to Okubo\nand ask if he did it.": "",
  "We go to him and ask\nif he's really innocent.": "",
  "You wanna talk to him face-to-face?\nMeeting with a death row inmate isn't that easy.": "",
  "You wanna talk to Okubo face-to-face?\nBut he's on death row, so...": "",
  "A lawyer like you should have\nno problem setting that up. Right?": "",
  "A lawyer like you could still\nset that meeting up. Right?": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Shinpei Okubo is still in jail.\nI could meet him, but...)</color>": "",
  "...He can't stand me, though.": "",
  "From day one, Okubo insisted he was innocent.\nThat he didn't kill Emi.": "",
  "Okubo's insisted from day one that he\ndidn't kill Emi Terasawa.": "",
  "But I... I abandoned him.\nTold him he'd be better off just giving up.": "",
  "But I... I abandoned him.\nTold him he should give up.": "",
  "Fine, but that's a pretty weak excuse\nfor not going to talk to him now.": "",
  "All the same... that's no reason\nnot to talk to him now.": "",
  "If you really wanna pursue this case,\nyou don't have a choice, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Yagami-san... If you want to solve this,\nyou don't have a choice.": "",
  "...Well?": "",
  "Hoshino-kun...": "",
  "Let's go talk to Okubo.\nThink you can arrange that for me?": "",
  "I wanna talk to Shinpei Okubo.\nSo... can you arrange that?": "",
  "I can try.\nLet me get in touch with the prison.": "",
  "Thanks.\nI'll be at Genda's if you wanna find me.": "",
  "In the meantime, I'm gonna review\nthe Okubo case files again.": "",
  "Looking over the old case files.": "",
  "I'll be over at Genda-sensei's.": "",
  "Guess I was pretty harsh earlier.\nSorry about that.": "",
  "Guess I was kinda\nharsh earlier... Sorry.": "",
  "Goin' to see Okubo, huh?\nWon't be easy for you... but you can do it, man.": "",
  "Goin' to see Okubo, huh...?\nSounds like it ain't gonna be easy on you.": "",
  "I'll let you know once I've made the arrangements\nto get you in to see him.": "",
  "Once I've made arrangements to see Okubo,\nI'll get in contact with you.": "",
  "Oh, Yagami.\nYou need something?": "",
  "Oh... Need something, Yagami?": "",
  "Mind if I look over a case file?\nThe ADDC one, from three years ago.": "",
  "I'm seeing Okubo soon.": "",
  "I'm going to see Shinpei Okubo soon.": "",
  "Huh? What do you mean,\nyou're seeing Okubo?": "",
  "Huh? What's all this about now?": "",
  "Hold on, I'll go pull the documents up.": "",
  "Understood. I'll go pull\nthe documents up.": "",
  "Thanks, Saori-san.": "",
  "How's it going, Yagami-san?": "",
  "Will these do, Yagami-san?": "",
  "Oh, not bad.": "",
  "Mm? Oh, thanks.": "",
  "...What do you have there?": "",
  "The files for Emi Terasawa's case.\nI thought they might be useful, too.": "",
  "The files for Emi Terasawa's case.\nI thought they could be useful, too.": "",
  "Well, er...": "",
  "I don't know if...": "",
  "Yagami-san. I think you should look them over\nif you're going to talk to Okubo.": "",
  "I think you should look them over\nif you're going to see Okubo.": "",
  "If you really don't need them, just leave them here.\nI'll put everything back later. ": "",
  "Emi Terasawa. 26 years old at time of death.": "",
  "Emi Terasawa.\n26 years old at the time of her death.": "",
  "December 2nd, 2015. About 11 PM. Her body is found on\nthe second floor of a burnt-out apartment building.": "",
  "December 2nd, 2015. About 11 PM. Her body is found\non the second floor of a burnt-out apartment building.": "",
  "Fifteen stab wounds to the chest, presumably inflicted\nwhile she was still alive. Cause of death: Blood loss.": "",
  "No ash in her lungs, so she didn't inhale any smoke.\nEmi died before the fire started.": "",
  "No ash in her lungs, so she didn't inhale any smoke.\nSo... Emi died before the fire started.": "",
  "Shinpei Okubo, the victim's boyfriend and roommate,\nwas found at the scene and arrested.": "",
  "Murder weapon is thought to be a kitchen knife.\nIt was covered in Okubo's prints.": "",
  "Murder weapon is thought to be a kitchen knife.\nThing was covered in Okubo's prints.": "",
  "Okubo was wasted out of his mind\nwhen firefighters arrived at the apartment.": "",
  "And... when firefighters arrived at the apartment,\nOkubo was drunk out of his mind.": "",
  "Okubo-san is not a violent person.": "",
  "But Okubo claims he doesn't remember ever\ndrinking. That he woke up surrounded by flames.": "",
  "But according to Okubo, he doesn't remember ever\ndrinking. He woke up surrounded by flames.": "",
  "He's pleaded innocence from day one.": "",
  "Ever since the beginning,\nhe's pleaded innocent.": "",
  "Do you really have to do this?\nGo see Okubo, I mean.": "",
  "Yeah, looks like I do.": "",
  "...Yep. Looks like it.": "",
  "I need to know if he was really innocent.\nIf he killed Waku-san three years ago.": "",
  "I'm going to find the truth, Genda-sensei.": "",
  "I'm going there so I can\nfind the truth.": "",
  "What, in just one little prison chat?": "",
  "What, in just one little\nvisitor's chat?": "",
  "Either way, I never felt like I closed\nthe book on this. I should have done this years ago.": "",
  "Either way, it's always felt like\nI needed to see him again.": "",
  "I mean... Yeah, I defended him in court.": "",
  "Shinpei Okubo... Yeah, I defended\nhim in court.": "",
  "But we didn't have anything\ndefinitive to prove his innocence.": "",
  "But we didn't have anything definitive\nto prove his innocence.": "",
  "The only thing the ruling said was that\nthey couldn't conclusively prove his guilt.": "",
  "We got a ruling, but all it proved was that\nthey couldn't conclusively prove Okubo's guilt.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Yeah, yeah.": "เออๆ",
  "I dunno...": "ไม่รู้สิ...",
  "Are you?": "จริงเหรอ?",
  "Say what?": "พูดว่าไงนะ?",
  "It's simple.": "ง่ายมาก",
  "...Well?": "...แล้วไง?"
 }
}
